Package: pve-gpu-manager
Architecture: all
Depends: pve-manager (>= 8.0), libpve-common-perl, pciutils, linux-perf, ${misc:Depends}, ${perl:Depends}
Description: GPU Manager for Proxmox VE
 Provides discovery, monitoring, and SR-IOV virtual function management
 for supported Intel Battlemage GPUs in Proxmox VE. Includes a web UI tab,
 REST API, and boot persistence.
